# Vitest browser-mode failure artefacts.
#
# Both directories are written only when a test fails: `__screenshots__/` holds the page
# capture attached to the failure report, `.vitest-attachments/` the raw blobs behind it.
# They are regenerated on the next failing run and are meaningless afterwards — committing
# them would put a binary snapshot of a bug that no longer exists into the history.
#
# Scoped to this package rather than added to the root .gitignore, because these paths are
# an artefact of the web app's test runner and belong with it.
.vitest-attachments/
src/tests/__screenshots__/
